# HLD-009 LADR-09: the viewer image vendors the capture scripts (build from the
# repo root). Last match wins, and a child of an excluded tree cannot be
# re-included without reopening each parent — so every level is reopened and
# immediately shut again except the scripts folder itself.
!.agents
.agents/*
!.agents/skills
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/_mimisbrunnr-shared
.agents/skills/_mimisbrunnr-shared/*
!.agents/skills/_mimisbrunnr-shared/scripts
**/__pycache__
